ission to an exotic tyranny, local ruler with a God complex, fight scene with a memorably disfigured strongman, love interest casually dispensed with as soon as the plot\u2019s wrapped up, one might even include Daedalus\u2019s magical thread as the original Q-branch gadget!</div> </div> </div> </div>Jason and the Argonauts is basically an ancient greek Avengers.<br /> <br /> Some of the cast...<ul><li>Heracles</li> <li>Theseus (slayer of the minotaur, and huge asshole)</li> <li>Castor and Pollux (of gemini, and one being the son of zeus in the from of a swan, fame)</li> <li>Orpheus (epic bard with poor impulse control)</li> <li>Zetes and Cala\u00efs (the wind brothers, sons of the north wind)</li> <li>Peleus (father of Achilles with a lot of his own stuff going on)</li> <li>Polyphemus (a dude so strong he punched centaurs to death)</li> <li>Pretty much the father or grandfather of everyone participating in the Trojan War</li> </ul>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-27T07:53:20-07:00","id":1536360,"title":"","content":"You could also make a case for JASON AND THE ARGONAUTS as the original \u2018Dirty Dozen\u2019 (Given that the average Classical hero did crimes with all the enthusiasm of a DnD adventuring party).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom